{"4628090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "I Woke Up In An RPG", "steam_appid": 4628090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5123140], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I Woke Up In An RPG</strong> is a story-rich 3D action-RPG with fast, soulslike-inspired combat. <br><br>After a fatal accident, you awaken inside your favorite game, but this is not the world you remember. The story is changing, characters are losing their memories, and reality itself is breaking apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind the glitches before you’re lost in the game for good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628090/extras/bf332ef59f210daddd92c4bb0929f92d.poster.avif?t=1787672474\" width=560 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628090/extras/bf332ef59f210daddd92c4bb0929f92d.webm?t=1787672474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628090/extras/bf332ef59f210daddd92c4bb0929f92d.mp4?t=1787672474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soulslike-inspired combat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Fighter, Archer,</strong> or <strong>Mage </strong>playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your build with <strong>runes, spells,  infusions,</strong> and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60</strong> Zelda-inspired <strong>Blights</strong>, each with unique challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat <strong>8 major bosses</strong> to open the path to the Demon King’s castle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a <strong>semi-open world </strong>with over<strong> 50 unique enemies</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shape Your Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between <strong>Fighter, Archer,</strong> or <strong>Mage</strong>, each with their own combat style and abilities. Customize your experience by equipping runes, swapping spells, infusing weapons, and unlocking new skills. Adapt your build to defeat many different kinds of enemies. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628090/extras/1c38f2991d607bcb0755fad46b93def7.poster.avif?t=1787672474\" width=560 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628090/extras/1c38f2991d607bcb0755fad46b93def7.webm?t=1787672474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628090/extras/1c38f2991d607bcb0755fad46b93def7.mp4?t=1787672474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet Theo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Theo is your trusty cat-companion who was sent to this world with you. While he was once a regular house cat, Theo now walks, talks, and fight monsters with you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628090/extras/b881d9ae49b8b0734b7b50c080f4e087.poster.avif?t=1787672474\" width=560 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628090/extras/b881d9ae49b8b0734b7b50c080f4e087.webm?t=1787672474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628090/extras/b881d9ae49b8b0734b7b50c080f4e087.mp4?t=1787672474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defeat the Gatekeepers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path to the Demon King’s castle is sealed. To open it, you must defeat the <strong>8 powerful main bosses</strong> that rule each region. Each victory brings you closer to the truth behind the glitches. Keep an eye out for mini-bosses too, they may drop a powerful item! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628090/extras/e15fc141385fe68f3ae22142ac6870ec.poster.avif?t=1787672474\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628090/extras/e15fc141385fe68f3ae22142ac6870ec.webm?t=1787672474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628090/extras/e15fc141385fe68f3ae22142ac6870ec.mp4?t=1787672474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cleanse the Blights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden throughout the world are mysterious Blights destroying the land around them. Enter these unstable zones, overcome varied challenges, repair the damage, and earn valuable rewards. Could these be the source of the game breaking?<br>All <strong>60 Blights</strong> have a unique challenge in them varying from <strong>puzzles</strong>,  <strong>mini-games</strong>, to full on <strong>swarm fights</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628090/extras/b302bc2b7517586f421b1f5663b26b9d.poster.avif?t=1787672474\" width=616 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628090/extras/b302bc2b7517586f421b1f5663b26b9d.webm?t=1787672474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628090/extras/b302bc2b7517586f421b1f5663b26b9d.mp4?t=1787672474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft, Upgrade, and Prepare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to collect <strong>Wisps</strong>, a resource used to upgrade abilities, unlock spells, and purchase items. <br>Gather materials across the world to craft potions, create runes, and strengthen your weapons for the journey ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628090/extras/c9dc399b01693d981b7384d97a94905b.poster.avif?t=1787672474\" width=560 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628090/extras/c9dc399b01693d981b7384d97a94905b.webm?t=1787672474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628090/extras/c9dc399b01693d981b7384d97a94905b.mp4?t=1787672474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Dangerous World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through a diverse semi-open world filled with secrets, each leading you closer to learning why you were brought here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628090/extras/bc41ff03dd2e9bb384a78ae94db4b28a.poster.avif?t=1787672474\" width=560 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628090/extras/bc41ff03dd2e9bb384a78ae94db4b28a.webm?t=1787672474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628090/extras/bc41ff03dd2e9bb384a78ae94db4b28a.mp4?t=1787672474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet Friends Along the Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your journey, you will meet characters who can teach you new skills, or generally aid you on your journey. As the world begins to break apart, it becomes harder to see them as just characters in a game. <br><br>Skills you can learn:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rune Crafting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And Many More! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character has a dynamic, fully-illustrated sprite that appears in conversation. All are fully romanceable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628090/extras/0b87751106d9d1037b8640bb4699a92f.avif?t=1787672474\" width=780 height=571 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More characters being revealed soon!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628090/extras/e17c56351b55dd83098a86c795071c37.poster.avif?t=1787672474\" width=780 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628090/extras/e17c56351b55dd83098a86c795071c37.webm?t=1787672474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628090/extras/e17c56351b55dd83098a86c795071c37.mp4?t=1787672474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I Woke Up In An RPG</strong> is a story-rich 3D action-RPG with fast, soulslike-inspired combat. <br><br>After a fatal accident, you awaken inside your favorite game, but this is not the world you remember. The story is changing, chara